<title>VENEZUELA: TABLE-Mantex H1 net drops.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Mantex H1 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net 1.021 billion bolivars vs 8.256 billion bolivars</p>
<p>Revs 14.862 billion bolivars vs 16.164 billion bolivars</p>
<p>Monetray gain 2.161 billion bolivars vs 5.270 billion bolivars</p>
<p>NOTES: Period ending June 30</p>
<p>Results are inflation adjusted</p>
<p>Mantex SACA is a Venezuelan textile manufacturing company</p>
<p>One American Depository Receipt is equivalent to 1,500 ordinary shares</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
